openMCX modifications of the OpenAirInterface eNB and LTE UE
============================================================

The images openmcx/oai-enb:2026.w39-mcx and openmcx/oai-lte-ue:2026.w39-mcx built from this directory contain the
OpenAirInterface eNB (lte-softmodem) and LTE UE (lte-uesoftmodem; OpenAirInterface Software Alliance,
https://gitlab.eurecom.fr/oai/openairinterface5g), tag 2026.w39, commit 29d5fa7d38bb1ee8935ef7ae30a396d53772ea4f,
modified by openMCX for tutorial 5 (MCX over LTE).

