Modifications (CSSL section 5.2)
--------------------------------
Each modified file carries the notice "Modified by openMCX, 2026 (MCX over LTE)". The changes, as patches against
commit 29d5fa7:

  patches/openairinterface5g/0001   The UE accepts every type of tracking area identity list (TS 24.301 clause
                                    9.9.3.33): the decoder lists the TAIs of every partial list of type 00, 01 or 10
                                    (at most 16), and the Attach Accept uses them. Before, any list but type 01 was
                                    rejected with EMM cause 99.
  patches/openairinterface5g/0002   The modification notices.
  patches/openairinterface5g/0003   An ESM message received with a new NAS signalling connection (TS 24.301 clause
                                    5.3.1), for example the Activate Dedicated EPS Bearer Context Request of a bearer
                                    set up after a service request, goes to ESM as on an established connection.
                                    Before, the UE expected an EMM message there and answered EMM Status cause 98, so
                                    the dedicated bearer was never accepted.
  patches/openairinterface5g/0004   A Deactivate EPS Bearer Context Request without a PTI (a deactivation by the
                                    network, TS 24.301 clause 6.4.4.2) is processed. Before, it was discarded as a PTI
                                    mismatch and the released bearer stayed active in the UE.
  patches/openairinterface5g/0005   The NAS messages of an RRCConnectionReconfiguration go to NAS as copies, which
                                    NAS frees, and the decoded message is freed once. Before, the UE freed part of
                                    the message twice and crashed on the RRCConnectionReconfiguration that releases a
                                    dedicated bearer.
  patches/openairinterface5g/0006   DRBs are released (TS 36.331 clause 5.3.10.2): the eNB and the UE delete the RLC
                                    entity of each DRB of a drb-ToReleaseList, and the UE also its PDCP entity and
                                    DRB configuration. Before, the eNB exited on the RRCConnectionReconfiguration
                                    that releases a dedicated bearer, and the UE ignored the list.
  patches/openairinterface5g/0007   The eNB deletes the GTP-U tunnel of a released E-RAB. Before, the released
                                    bearer stayed in the UE's tunnel list, and when the network set the E-RAB up again
                                    the eNB erased the whole list, the default bearer's tunnel included.
  patches/openairinterface5g/0008   The UE removes a released EPS bearer context from its bearer table. Before, the
                                    table kept a pointer to the freed context, and a bearer set up again with the same
                                    EPS bearer identity was refused as already assigned.

Corresponding source
--------------------
The complete source of the images is the upstream repository at tag 2026.w39 with the patches above applied:
build-images.sh recreates it and builds the images from it with OAI's own Dockerfiles. Each image names the commit
and the patches' SHA-256 in /usr/share/doc/openmcx-oai/SOURCE and as labels. This also provides the source of the
third-party components the images contain, under their own licenses (OAI's LICENSES/ directory).
